  "criticalEvidence": [
    "Audio26376 computes original basename via last forward slash and first dot before culture-sensitive path.ToLower. New flag36 branch awaits typed handle, casts MainObject and retains handle; does not call legacy logs/packs.",
    "Legacy branch logs lower path and original-case basename, bundle=lower+.unity3d, reads live pack dictionary twice (ContainsKey then get_Item after CLog). Present entry loads AudioClip synchronously; null/missing asset does not fallback. Else GetModule<AssetbundleModule>._LoadAsset<AudioClip>(bundle,basename,null).",
    "New-only26378 evaluates unused basename then ToLower and awaits modern helper without its own mode guard. Unload26375 lowercases/appends before checking current mode; modern does not call legacy unload.",
    "New helper26176/26186 guard26181 false logs then null, true resolves new module and awaits typed module operation. GetNewResModule26169 selects AppSetting field40 true KeWanResLoadModule3511, false YOResourcesModule3527. Actual module acquisition remains explicit boundary.",
    "AssetbundleModule._LoadAsset26253 calls CheckUseRightResLoad and ignores its bool; requests native operation, null operation returns default without log; awaits IEnumerator, GetAsset<T>, native-null logs exact failure text and returns asset.",
    "AssetBundleManager23827 checks legacy then RemapVariantName, LoadAssetBundle(mapped,false,original), constructs AssetBundleLoadAssetOperationFull and adds shared operation list. Operation23791 returns false as soon as native request exists, rather than waiting for request completion. IsDone23792 returns request.isDone or logs any nonnull error (including0) and returns true; failed operation can remain in manager list.",
    "IEnumeratorAwait22357 -> callback22389 -> shared constructor22371/Run22374/MoveNext22377. MoveNext catches IEnumerator.MoveNext exceptions and completes awaiter; native asset operation is sealed, Current=null and no compiler-generated $this parents, so dedicated source specialization needs no nested coroutine/object-trace synthesis. Existing generic single-yield helper would lose this exception and was not used for the final asset wait."
  ],
